# Ship a complete, runnable test suite in the sdist so distro packagers
# can run it. setuptools' default sdist only sweeps up top-level
# tests/test_*.py — it drops conftest.py, the shared helpers, and every
# test subpackage, leaving an unrunnable pile of imports. Graft the whole
# tree instead (see #45).
graft tests
include CHANGELOG.md
include ARCHITECTURE.md
include CONTRIBUTING.md
include SECURITY.md

# Never ship compiled artifacts or local caches.
global-exclude *.py[cod]
global-exclude *.so
prune tests/**/__pycache__
